uest":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115932","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115932","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115932.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115932.patch","merged_at":"2026-02-25T15:34:13Z"},"body":"When a transient dock like the TileMap dock is on the vertical orientation and is closed while active, the TabContainer opens the adjacent dock to it, instead of the dock that was open before the TileMap was selected. \r\n\r\nThis PR makes it so that after closing a dock, the previous dock is opened instead of an adjacent dock.\r\n\r\nI moved the `hide()` that reduced signals because the previous location updated the `TabContainer`'s `current` and `previous` values, preventing the fix from working. The main fix is three lines, the rest is just making sure that the `TabContainer`'s `previous` is accurate.\r\n\r\n*Bugsquad edit:* Fixes #114352","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115932/reactions","total